# {{ site.name }}

> {{ site.description | safe }}

{{ site.name }} is based in Belleville, Ontario, Canada. He works in four areas:

- **Photography:** environmental and editorial portraits of people at work.
- **Brand strategy:** helping businesses and creatives get clear on what they stand for and how they show it.
- **Consulting:** working conversations with leaders and teams on clarity, direction and decision-making.
- **Speaking:** facilitated talks that help groups slow down, think clearly and ask better questions.

He also hosts *Amplified*, a long-form podcast of conversations with people who build meaningful things, and writes about creative work, leadership and building in public.

To get in touch: email {{ site.email }}, or use the contact form at {{ site.url }}/#contact (reasons: Photography, Brand Strategy, Consulting, Speaking).

